WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.759
Meet PowerPoint2Vid.

00:00:01.759 --> 00:00:06.509
It turns a PowerPoint deck into a narrated explainer video, right in your browser.

00:00:08.009 --> 00:00:09.572
You already wrote the story.

00:00:09.572 --> 00:00:12.194
It lives in your slides and your speaker notes.

00:00:12.194 --> 00:00:14.537
But recording a video by hand takes hours.

00:00:14.537 --> 00:00:15.765
There is a faster way.

00:00:17.265 --> 00:00:18.087
Add your deck.

00:00:18.087 --> 00:00:19.554
Pick a voice and a style.

00:00:19.554 --> 00:00:20.199
Preview it.

00:00:20.199 --> 00:00:20.903
Then export.

00:00:20.903 --> 00:00:25.833
Your speaker notes become the script, and shapes animate in as each point is spoken.

00:00:27.333 --> 00:00:29.191
Everything runs in your browser.

00:00:29.191 --> 00:00:32.674
Nothing is uploaded, so your slides never leave your device.

00:00:32.674 --> 00:00:35.750
There is no sign-up and no watermark, and it is free.

00:00:37.250 --> 00:00:38.698
Try it with your own deck.

00:00:38.698 --> 00:00:42.707
Head to powerpoint2vid.com and turn your slides into a video in minutes.

